    <!-- ================================================================
         ENTRY RAMP (ViSSim link 7)
         L7a: Polyline through all ViSSim link-7 polypoints (R7_1 is the OD origin).
         L7m: Bezier with OffsetEnd=-3.6m places FORWARD1 at 1.8-3.6=-1.8m
           at N3_4, matching L4a.FORWARD3 there.
